{
 "dataset": "tiny-qwen35",
 "note": "seeded Qwen3.5 (Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration, text only), 4 layers of the default types: 0..2 linear_attention (Gated DeltaNet: 2 key and 2 value heads of 16, a depthwise causal convolution of 4 with silu, q and k L2-normed, beta = sigmoid(b), decay g = -exp(A_log) softplus(a + dt_bias), a gated RMSNorm per value head, out_proj), 3 full_attention (4 heads of 32, 2 KV heads, q_proj twice as wide: per head the query, then the gate; q and k normed; a quarter of each head rotating with theta 1e7; the output times sigmoid(gate)); RMSNorms times (1 + weight), the gated one times its weight; hidden 64, SwiGLU 96; tied head; BF16 weights; a tiny vision tower under model.visual. and one mtp tensor, both outside the text model. Per case (5, 13, 29 tokens): embed, layerNN, layer00_attn (the DeltaNet output), layer00_mlp, norm, logits (all positions, one pass: the chunked delta rule), logits_steps (the same positions one token at a time with the cache: the recurrent rule), greedy (24 tokens, no eos) with the top-2 margin - checked equal with the transformers cache and without. rope.cos / rope.sin [64, 4]",
